{"task":"transcribe","language":"English","duration":64.085311488,"text":" One spoonful of Greek yogurt begins an incredible journey, entering your mouth where chewing and saliva prepare it for healthy digestion. After swallowing, the yogurt smoothly travels down your esophagus, moving safely toward the stomach through gentle muscle contractions. Inside your stomach, digestive juices break down the yogurt's protein, preparing valuable nutrients for absorption throughout your body. The probiotics reach your small intestine, where they interact with your gut microbiome and help support a healthy digestive environment. Tiny intestinal villi absorb protein, calcium, and vitamins, sending these essential nutrients directly into your bloodstream. Your bloodstream delivers these nutrients to muscles, bones, and organs, helping fuel normal body functions every single day. Beneficial bacteria thrive inside your gut, helping maintain microbial balance and supporting healthy digestion from within. From stronger bones to better digestion, Greek yogurt provides nutrients that help keep your body healthy, energized, and functioning at its best.","words":[{"word":"One","start":0.1,"end":0.32},{"word":"spoonful","start":0.32,"end":0.8},{"word":"of","start":0.8,"end":1.06},{"word":"Greek","start":1.06,"end":1.32},{"word":"yogurt","start":1.32,"end":1.58},{"word":"begins","start":1.58,"end":1.98},{"word":"an","start":1.98,"end":2.16},{"word":"incredible","start":2.16,"end":2.58},{"word":"journey,","start":2.58,"end":3.46},{"word":"entering","start":3.46,"end":3.74},{"word":"your","start":3.74,"end":3.92},{"word":"mouth","start":3.92,"end":4.18},{"word":"where","start":4.18,"end":4.4},{"word":"chewing","start":4.4,"end":4.74},{"word":"and","start":4.74,"end":4.94},{"word":"saliva","start":4.48,"end":5.42},{"word":"prepare","start":5.42,"end":5.8},{"word":"it","start":5.8,"end":5.92},{"word":"for","start":5.92,"end":6.04},{"word":"healthy","start":6.04,"end":6.32},{"word":"digestion.",